<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">DANIEL</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="mt1">DANIEL</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1"/>Nan twazyèm ane a règn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">II Wa 24:1</ref></char></note>Jojakim, wa Juda a; Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te rive Jérusalem e te fè syèj sou li. <verse eid="DAN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2"/>Senyè a te livre Jojakim, wa Juda a, nan men li, ansanm ak kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:7">II Kwo 36:7</ref></char></note>veso lakay Bondye yo. Epi Nebucadnetsar te pote yo nan peyi Schinear, kote lakay dye pa li a, e li te mennen veso yo antre nan trezò a dye li a.<verse eid="DAN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3"/>Alò, wa a te pase lòd a Aschpenaz, chèf sou ofisye pa l yo, pou mennen kèk nan fis Israël yo, ansanm ak kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:15">II Wa 24:15</ref></char></note>fanmi wayal la ak kèk nan prens yo: <verse eid="DAN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4"/>jennonm ki te san defo, ki te bo gason, ki te montre yo entèlijan nan tout kalite sajès, beni avèk bon konprann e ak kapasite pou disène, e ki te gen kapasite pou fè sèvis nan palè a wa a; pou l ta ka enstwi yo nan lèt ak langaj Kaldeyen yo. <verse eid="DAN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5"/>Wa a te chwazi pou yo yon pòsyon manje ki te sòti nan meyè manje a wa a ak nan diven ke li te konn bwè. Anplis, li te fè lòd pou yo ta kapab fè enstriksyon lekòl pandan twazan, epi nan fen a twazan yo, yo te dwe antre nan sèvis pèsonèl a wa a.<verse eid="DAN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6"/>Alò, pami yo, soti nan fis a Juda yo, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:14-20">Éz 14:14-20</ref></char></note>Daniel, Hanania, Mischaël, ak Azaria. <verse eid="DAN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7"/>Answit, chèf nan linik yo te bay nouvo non a yo menm. Pou Daniel, li te bay non Beltschatsar, Hanania non a Schadrac, Mischaël non a Méschac e Azaria, non a Abed-Nego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8"/>Men Daniel te pran desizyon nan panse li pou li pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:47">Lev 11:47</ref></char></note>souye tèt li ak meyè manje a wa a, ni ak diven li te konn bwè a. Konsa, li te chache pèmisyon a chèf nan linik yo pou li pa ta souye tèt li. <verse eid="DAN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9"/>Alò, Bondye te bay Daniel <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:21">Jen 39:21</ref></char></note>favè ak gras devan zye a chèf ofisye yo. <verse eid="DAN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10"/>Epi chèf nan linik yo te di a Daniel: “Mwen gen krent mèt mwen, Wa a, ki te bay lòd konsènan manje nou ak bwason nou. Paske poukisa li ta dwe wè figi nou nan yon eta pi mal ke lòt jennonm ki gen menm laj avèk nou yo? Alò, nou ta fè mwen peye pri tèt mwen bay wa a.”<verse eid="DAN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11"/>Men Daniel te di a sipèvizè ke chèf nan linik yo te chwazi sou Daniel, Hanania, Mischaël, ak Azaria a, <verse eid="DAN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12"/>“Souple, teste sèvitè ou yo pandan di jou. Kite nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:16">Dan 1:16</ref></char></note>resevwa sèlman kèk legim pou manje ak dlo pou bwè. <verse eid="DAN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13"/>Epi konsa, kite aparans nou vin konpare ak aparans a jennonm k ap manje meyè manje a wa a; epi aji ak sèvitè ou yo selon sa ou wè a.” <verse eid="DAN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14"/>Konsa, li te koute yo nan bagay sa a, e te teste yo pandan di jou.<verse eid="DAN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:25">Egz 23:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan fen di jou yo, aparans yo te parèt pi bon, e yo te angrese plis ke tout jennonm ki t ap manje meyè manje a wa a. <verse eid="DAN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16"/>Akoz sa, sipèvizè a te kontinye retire meyè manje sa yo, ak diven yo te dwe pou bwè, e te kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:12">Dan 1:12</ref></char></note>bay yo legim yo.<verse eid="DAN 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17"/>Konsènan kat jennonm sila yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:12-28">I Wa 3:12-28</ref></char></note>Bondye te bay yo konesans ak entèlijans nan tout pati etid ak sajès yo. Epi Daniel te gen konprann nan tout kalite vizyon ak rèv.<verse eid="DAN 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18"/>Konsa, nan fen jou wa a te etabli pou prezante yo a, linik a wa a te fè yo parèt devan Nebucadnetsar. <verse eid="DAN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19"/>Wa a te pale ak yo e pami yo tout, pa t gen youn ki te konpare ak Daniel, Hanania, Mischaël, ak Azaria. Akoz sa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:46">Jen 41:46</ref></char></note>antre nan sèvis pèsonèl a wa a. <verse eid="DAN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20"/>Pou chak sikonstans ke wa a te konsilte yo pou sajès ak bon konprann, li te twouve yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:30-31">I Wa 4:30-31</ref></char></note>dis fwa pi bon ke tout majisyen ak mèt zetwal ki te nan tout wayòm li a.<verse eid="DAN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21"/>Epi Daniel te kontinye jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:28">Dan 6:28</ref></char></note>premye ane Cyrus, wa a.<verse eid="DAN 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1"/>Alò, nan dezyèm ane règn Nebucadnetsar a, Nebucadnetsar te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:5-8">Jen 40:5-8</ref></char></note>fè rèv yo. Epi lespri li te twouble, e li pa t ka dòmi. <verse eid="DAN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2"/>Konsa, wa a te pase lòd pou rele fè antre tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8">Jen 41:8</ref></char></note>majisyen yo, mèt zetwal yo, moun ki fè cham, mèt wanga ak Kaldeyen yo pou pale ak wa a, e fè l tande ki rèv li te fè yo. Konsa, yo te antre e te kanpe devan wa a. <verse eid="DAN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3"/>Wa a te di yo: “Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:8">Jen 40:8</ref></char></note>te fè yon rèv e lespri m vin twouble pou l ta konprann rèv la.”<verse eid="DAN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4"/>Kaldeyen yo te pale ak wa a an Arameyen: “O wa, viv jis pou tout tan! Pale rèv la a sèvitè ou yo e nou va deklare entèpretasyon li.”<verse eid="DAN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5"/>Wa a te reponn a Kaldeyen yo: “Lòd mwen an fin etabli: si nou pa fè m konnen rèv la ak entèpretasyon li a, nou va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 6:11">Éz 6:11</ref></char></note>chire mòso an mòso, e lakay nou va vin yon pil ranblè. <verse eid="DAN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6"/>Men si nou deklare rèv la ak entèpretasyon li, nou va resevwa nan men m, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:48">Dan 2:48</ref></char></note>kado, rekonpans ak gwo lonè. Pou sa, fè m deklarasyon rèv la ak entèpretasyon li.”<verse eid="DAN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7"/>Yo te reponn yon dezyèm fwa. Yo te di: “Kite wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref></char></note>eksplike rèv la a sèvitè li yo e nou va deklare entèpretasyon li.”<verse eid="DAN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8"/>Wa a te reponn: “Mwen konnen, anverite, ke nou ap jwe pou tan, paske nou te wè ke lòd mwen an gentan fin byen etabli. <verse eid="DAN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9"/>Men si nou pa fè m konnen rèv la, ap gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:11">Est 4:11</ref></char></note>yon sèl dekrè pou nou. Paske nou te vin antann nou, youn ak lòt pou fè manti ak pale pawòl konwonpi devan m, jiskaske bagay la vin chanje. Pou sa a, fè m konnen rèv la pou m ka konnen ke nou kapab deklare entèpretasyon li ban mwen.”<verse eid="DAN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10"/>Kaldeyen yo te reponn wa a, e te di: “Nanpwen yon nonm sou latè ki kapab deklare bagay la bay wa a, otan ke okenn gwo wa oswa chèf pa t janm mande okenn bagay konsa a okenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2-27">Dan 2:2-27</ref></char></note>majisyen, mèt wanga, oswa Kaldeyen. <verse eid="DAN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11"/>Anplis, bagay ke wa a mande a difisil, e nanpwen okenn lòt moun ki ka deklare li bay wa a sof ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39">Jen 41:39</ref></char></note>dye yo, ki pa rete nan chè mòtèl.”<verse eid="DAN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12"/>Akoz sa, wa a te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:10">Sòm 76:10</ref></char></note>ranpli ak kòlè ak gwo mekontantman, e li te bay lòd pou detwi tout mesye saj Babylone yo. <verse eid="DAN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13"/>Konsa, dekrè a te pibliye ke mesye saj yo ta dwe touye. Konsa, yo t ap chache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:19-20">Dan 1:19-20</ref></char></note>Daniel ak zanmi li yo pou touye yo.<verse eid="DAN 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14"/>Men Daniel te reponn ak sajès e ak bon konprann a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:24">Dan 2:24</ref></char></note>Ajoc, chèf kò gad a wa a, ki te ale deyò pou touye mesye saj a Babylone yo. <verse eid="DAN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15"/>Li te di a Ajoc, chèf pou wa a: “Pou ki rezon dekrè a wa a prese konsa?” Epi Ajoc te pale Daniel tout bagay la. <verse eid="DAN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16"/>Konsa, Daniel te antre anndan e te fè yon demann a wa a pou li ta bay li tan, pou l ta ka deklare entèpretasyon an bay a wa a.<verse eid="DAN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17"/>Epi Daniel te ale lakay li. Li te fè zanmi li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:6">Dan 1:6</ref></char></note>Hanania, Mischaël, ak Azaria okouran konsènan bagay sila a, <verse eid="DAN 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18"/>pou yo ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:15">Est 4:15</ref></char></note>fè yon demann mizerikòd a Bondye syèl la konsènan mistè sa a, pou Daniel ak zanmi li yo pa ta vin detwi ak lòt nan mesye saj a Babylone yo. <verse eid="DAN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19"/>Konsa, mistè a te revele a Daniel nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:6">Nonb 12:6</ref></char></note>vizyon lanwit la. <verse eid="DAN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20"/>Daniel te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:20">“Kite non Bondye vin beni jis pou tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:20">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:11-12">I Kwo 29:11-12</ref></char></note>sajès ak pouvwa se pou Li.<verse eid="DAN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21"/>Se Li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:15">Sòm 31:15</ref></char></note>chanje tan ak sikonstans yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">Li retire wa e Li etabli wa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">Li bay sajès a moun saj yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">e konesans a moun ki gen bon konprann.<verse eid="DAN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22"/>Se Li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:22">Job 12:22</ref></char></note>revele sekre pwofond yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:22">Li fè parèt sa ki nan tenèb yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:22">e se limyè a ki rete avè L.<verse eid="DAN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23"/>A Ou menm, O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:42">Jen 31:42</ref></char></note>Bondye de papa zansèt mwen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">mwen remèsi Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Mwen bay Ou lwanj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">paske Ou te ban mwen sajès ak pouvwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Menm koulye a, Ou te fè m konnen sa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">ke nou te mande Ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Paske Ou te revele a nou menm pwoblem a wa a.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24"/>Akoz sa, Daniel te antre kote Ajoc, ke wa a te chwazi pou detwi mesye saj a Babylone yo. Li te antre e te pale avè l konsa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:12-13">Dan 2:12-13</ref></char></note> “Pa detwi mesye saj a Babylone yo! Pran m antre nan prezans a wa a, e mwen va deklare entèpretasyon an bay wa a.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25"/>Konsa, Ajoc te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:7">Dan 1:7</ref></char></note>mennen Daniel byen vit devan prezans a wa a, e li te pale avèk li konsa: “Mwen te twouve yon nonm pami egzile Juda yo ki kapab fè wa a konnen entèpretasyon an.”<verse eid="DAN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26"/>Wa a te di a Daniel, ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:8-27">Jen 46:8-27</ref></char></note>Beltschatsar: “Èske ou kapab fè m konnen rèv ke m te fè a, ak entèpretasyon li an?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27"/>Daniel te reponn devan wa a. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2-11">Dan 2:2-11</ref></char></note>“Konsènan mistè sou sila wa a te mande a, ni mesye saj yo, ni mèt zetwal yo, ni majisyen yo, ni divinò yo p ap kapab deklare sa a wa a. <verse eid="DAN 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28"/>Men gen yon Bondye nan syèl la ki devwale mistè yo, e Li te fè konnen a Wa Nebucadnetsar sa ki va rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:1">Jen 49:1</ref></char></note>dènye jou yo. Men rèv ak vizyon nan tèt ou yo sou kabann ou an, se konsa:<verse eid="DAN 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29"/>“Konsènan ou menm, o wa, pandan sou kabann ou an, refleksyon ou te vire vè sa ki ta vin rive nan tan ki gen pou vini yo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:23-47">Dan 2:23-47</ref></char></note>Sila ki fè revelasyon mistè yo te fè ou konnen sa k ap vini yo. <verse eid="DAN 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30"/>Men selon mwen menm, mistè sa a pa t revele a mwen menm akoz sajès ki plis pase tout lòt moun k ap viv yo, men pou bi ke entèpretasyon an ta kapab vin konnen a wa a, e ke ou ta ka konprann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:2">Sòm 139:2</ref></char></note>refleksyon a panse ou yo.<verse eid="DAN 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31"/>“Ou menm, O wa, ou t ap gade e vwala, te gen yon sèl gwo estati. Estati sa a, ki te byen laj e tèlman bèl, te kanpe devan ou e aparans li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:7">Hab 1:7</ref></char></note>etonan. <verse eid="DAN 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:38">Dan 2:38</ref></char></note>Tèt estati a an lò fen, lestomak ak bra li an ajan, vant li ak kwis li an bwonz, <verse eid="DAN 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33"/>janm li an fè, pye li, yon pati an fè e yon pati an ajil. <verse eid="DAN 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34"/>Ou te kontinye gade, jiskaske yon pyè wòch te taye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:25">Dan 8:25</ref></char></note>san men moun, e li ta frape estati a sou pye li ki fèt an fè ak ajil la e li te kraze yo an mòso. <verse eid="DAN 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35"/>Epi fè a, ajil la, bronz ak ajan an te vin kraze nan menm moman an e te vin tankou pay ki sòti sou glasi vannen nan gran sezon. Konsa, van te pote yo ale jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:10">Sòm 37:10</ref></char></note>yo pa t menm jwenn tras yo. Men wòch ki te frape estati a te vin fè yon gwo mòn, e te ranpli tout latè.<verse eid="DAN 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36"/>“Se sa ki te rèv la. Konsa, nou va bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:24">Dan 2:24</ref></char></note>lentèpretasyon li devan wa a. <verse eid="DAN 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37"/>Ou menm, O wa, ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:5">És 47:5</ref></char></note>wadèwa yo, a sila Bondye syèl la te bay wayòm nan, pouvwa, pwisans ak glwa a. <verse eid="DAN 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38"/>Epi nenpòt kote fis a lòm yo rete, oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:10-11">Sòm 50:10-11</ref></char></note>bèt nan chan yo, oswa zwazo syèl yo, Li te bay yo nan men ou, e Li te fè ou chèf sou yo. Ou se tèt an lò a.<verse eid="DAN 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39"/>“Apre ou, va leve yon lòt wayòm ki enferyè a ou menm e yon lòt twazyèm ak bwonz, ki va renye sou tout latè. <verse eid="DAN 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40"/>Epi va gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:23">Dan 7:23</ref></char></note>katriyèm wayòm ak fòs tankou fè. Menm jan ke fè a kraze e fann tout bagay yo, konsa, tankou fè ki kraze vin fè anpil mòso yo, li va vin kraze e fann tout sila yo an mòso. <verse eid="DAN 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41"/>Nan sila ou te wè pye ak dwèt pye yo, yon pati an fè ak yon pati an ajil la, li va yon wayòm divize. Men li va genyen nan li kapasite pou vin di kon fè, jan ou te wè fè a mele ak ajil la. <verse eid="DAN 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42"/>Dwèt pye li yo te mele fè ak kanari; konsa, yon pati nan wayòm nan va fò e yon pati va frajil. <verse eid="DAN 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43"/>Epi jan ou te wè fè a mele ak ajil òdinè a, yo va vin mele youn ak lòt nan jèm a lòm; men yo p ap kole byen youn ak lòt, menm jan fè a pa mele ak kanari.<verse eid="DAN 2:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44"/>“Nan jou a wa sila yo, Bondye syèl yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6-7">És 9:6-7</ref></char></note>etabli yon wayòm ki p ap janm detwi, e wayòm sa a p ap lese pou yon lòt pèp. Li va kraze e mete fen a tout wayòm sila yo, men li va, li menm dire pou tout tan. <verse eid="DAN 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45"/>Jan ou te wè ke yon wòch te taye sòti sou yon mòn san sèvi ak men moun e ke li te kraze fè a, bwonz lan, ajil la, ajan an, ak lò a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Det 10:17</ref></char></note>gran Bondye a te fè konnen a wa a sa ki va rive nan tan k ap vini an. Donk, rèv la vrè e entèpretasyon li fèt ak fidelite.”<verse eid="DAN 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46"/>Konsa, Wa Nebucadnetsar te tonbe sou figi li. Li te rann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:5-7">Dan 3:5-7</ref></char></note>omaj a Daniel e li te pase lòd pou prezante li ak yon ofrann ak lansan ki santi bon. <verse eid="DAN 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47"/>Wa a te reponn Daniel. Li te di: “Anverite, Bondye ou a se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Det 10:17</ref></char></note>Dye a tout dye yo, yon Senyè a wa yo, e youn ki devwale mistè yo; paske ou te vin gen kapasite pou revele mistè sila a.”<verse eid="DAN 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48"/>Konsa, wa a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-43">Jen 41:39-43</ref></char></note>Leve Daniel, te bay li anpil gwo kado. Li te fè li chèf sou tout pwovens a Babylone yo, e li te vin chèf an tèt a tout mesye saj a Babylone yo. <verse eid="DAN 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49"/>Daniel te fè yon demann a wa a, e wa a te chwazi Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego sou tout afè yo nan pwovens Babylone, men se te Daniel ki te rete nan pòtay a wa a.<verse eid="DAN 2:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1"/>Wa Nebucadnetsar te fè yon estati fèt an lò ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">I Wa 12:28</ref> </char></note>imaj lò, wotè a sila a te swasant koude e lajè li sis koude. Li te fè l monte sou plèn Dura nan pwovens a Babylone. <verse eid="DAN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2"/>Epi Nebucadnetsar, wa a, te voye rasanble tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:3-27">Dan 3:3-27</ref> </char></note>satrap yo, prefè yo, gouvènè yo, konseye yo, trezorye yo, jij yo, tout majistra ak chèf an pwovens yo pou vini nan seremoni dedikas imaj ke Nebucadnetsar, wa a, te fè monte a. <verse eid="DAN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3"/>Konsa, satrap yo, prefè yo, gouvènè yo, konseye yo, trezorye yo, jij yo, majistra yo ak tout chèf an pwovens yo te rasanble pou seremoni dedikas imaj ke Nebucadnetsar te fè monte a; epi yo te kanpe devan imaj ke Nebucadnetsar te fè monte a.<verse eid="DAN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4"/>Moun ki konn fè piblikasyon pou wa a te pwoklame byen fò: “A nou menm, lòd la bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:7">Dan 3:7</ref> </char></note>O pèp yo, nasyon yo ak tout lang yo, <verse eid="DAN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5"/>ke nan moman ke nou tande son a twonpèt la, flit la, bandyo a, saltiyon an, gita a, kònmiz lan, ak tout lòt kalite enstriman mizik yo, nou va pwostène nou pou adore imaj an lò ke Nebucadnetsar, wa a, te fè monte a. <verse eid="DAN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6"/>Men, nenpòt moun ki pa pwostène pou adore va, lapoula, vin jete nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:22">Jr 29:22</ref> </char></note>founo dife byen cho.”<verse eid="DAN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7"/>Pou sa, lè tout pèp yo te tande son a twonpèt la, flit la, bandyo a, saltiyon an, gita a, kònmiz lan, ak tout lòt kalite enstriman mizik yo, tout pèp yo, nasyon yo ak langaj yo te pwostène e te adore imaj an lò ke Nebucadnetsar, wa a, te fè monte a.<verse eid="DAN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8"/>Pou rezon sa a, nan lè sa a, kèk Kaldeyen te vin parèt pou fè pwosè kont Jwif yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:12-16">Éz 4:12-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9"/>Yo te pale e te di a Nebucadnetsar, wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref> </char></note>“O wa, viv jis pou tout tan! <verse eid="DAN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10"/>Ou menm, O wa, ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:12-14">Est 3:12-14</ref> </char></note>fè yon dekrè ke tout moun ki tande son a twonpèt la, flit la, bandyo a, saltiyon an, gita a, kònmiz lan, ak tout lòt kalite enstriman mizik yo, yo va pwostène pou adore imaj an lò a. <verse eid="DAN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11"/>Men nenpòt moun ki pa pwostène, va jete nan mitan a yon founo dife byen cho. <verse eid="DAN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12"/>Genyen sèten Jwif ke ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:49">Dan 2:49</ref> </char></note>chwazi sou administrasyon pwovens Babylone nan, Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego. Mesye sila yo, O wa, pa t okipe ou. Yo pa sèvi dye pa ou yo, ni adore imaj an lò ke ou te fè monte a.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13"/>Epi Nebucadnetsar <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:12">Dan 2:12</ref> </char></note>byen anraje ak kòlè te pase lòd pou mennen Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego. Epi mesye sila yo te mennen devan wa a. <verse eid="DAN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14"/>Nebucadnetsar te reponn e te di yo: “Èske se vrè, Schadrac, Méschac ak abed-Nego, ke nou pa sèvi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 46:1">És 46:1</ref> </char></note>dye mwen yo, ni adore imaj an lò ke mwen te fè monte a? <verse eid="DAN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15"/>Alò, si nou pare, nan moman nou tande son a twonpèt la, flit la, bandyo a, saltiyon an, gita a, kònmiz lan, ak tout lòt kalite enstriman mizik yo, pou nou pwostène e adore imaj ke mwen te fè a, se byen. Men, si nou pa adore, nou va byen vit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:6">Dan 3:6</ref></char></note>jete nan yon founo dife byen cho. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 5:2">Egz 5:2</ref> </char></note>ki dye ki genyen ki kapab delivre nou sòti nan men mwen?”<verse eid="DAN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 1:7">Dan 1:7</ref> </char>
    </note>Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego te reponn a wa a: “O Nebucadnetsar, nou pa oblije bay ou yon repons a kesyon sa a. <verse eid="DAN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17"/>Si se konsa, Bondye nou an, Sila ke nou sèvi a, kapab delivre nou soti nan founo dife byen cho a; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:37">I Sam 17:37</ref> </char></note>Li va delivre nou sòti nan men ou, O wa. <verse eid="DAN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18"/>Men menm si li pa fè sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:25">Eb 11:25</ref> </char></note>kite sa vin konnen a ou menm, O wa, ke nou p ap sèvi dye pa ou yo ni adore imaj fèt an lò ke ou te fè monte a.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19"/>Konsa, Nebucadnetsar te ranpli ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:7">Est 7:7</ref> </char></note>chalè kòlè e figi li te vin move kont Schadrac Méschac ak Abed-Nego. Li te reponn ak bay lòd pou monte chalè founo a sèt fwa plis ke li te konn brile a. <verse eid="DAN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20"/>Li te kòmande sèten gèrye vanyan ki te nan lame li a pou mare Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego, pou yo ta jete yo nan founo dife byen cho a. <verse eid="DAN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21"/>Alò, mesye sila yo te mare nèt ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:27">Dan 3:27</ref> </char></note>pantalon yo, mayo yo, kas yo, ak tout lòt rad pa yo, e yo te jete nan mitan founo dife byen cho a. <verse eid="DAN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22"/>Pou rezon sa a, akoz lòd a wa te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:33">Egz 12:33</ref> </char></note>byen ijan e founo a te vin tèlman cho, flanm dife a te touye mesye ki te pote, fè monte, Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego yo. <verse eid="DAN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23"/>Men twa mesye sila yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:2">És 43:2</ref></char></note>Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego te tonbe nan mitan founo dife byen cho a toujou mare.<verse eid="DAN 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24"/>Epi Nebucadnetsar, wa a, te vin etone e te kanpe vit. Li te di a wo ofisye li yo: “Se pa twa mesye nou te voye jete tou mare nan mitan dife a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:24">Yo te reponn a wa a: “Byen si, O wa.”<verse eid="DAN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25"/>Li te di: “Gade! Mwen wè kat mesye lage k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:3-9">Sòm 91:3-9</ref> </char></note>mache toupatou nan mitan dife a san yo pa gen anyen e aparans a katriyèm nan se tankou yon fis a dye yo!” <verse eid="DAN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26"/>Epi Nebucadnetsar te vin toupre pòt founo dife byen cho a. Li te pale e te di: “Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego, vini deyò, sèvitè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:17">Dan 3:17</ref></char></note>Bondye Pi Wo a, e vini isit!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:26">Konsa, Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:20">Det 4:20</ref> </char></note>te sòti nan mitan dife a. <verse eid="DAN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27"/>Satrap yo, prefè yo, gouvènè yo, ak wo ofisye a wa yo te reyini antoure yo. Yo te wè ke dife a pa t fè okenn efè sou kò a mesye sila yo. Ni menm cheve yo pa t brile, pantalon pa yo pa t abime, ni sant dife a pa t rive sou yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:2">És 43:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:21">Dan 3:21</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28"/>Nebucadnetsar te pale. Li te di: “Beni se Bondye a Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego a, ki te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:7-8">Sòm 34:7-8</ref></char></note>zanj Li pou te delivre sèvitè Li yo ki te mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:4-5">Sòm 22:4-5</ref> </char></note>konfyans yo nan Li, ki te chanje lòd a wa a e ki te sede bay kò yo pou yo pa ta sèvi ni adore okenn lòt dye sof ke Bondye pa yo a. <verse eid="DAN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29"/>Konsa, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:26">Dan 6:26</ref></char></note>fè yon dekrè ke nenpòt pèp, nasyon, oswa lang ki pale yon bagay kont Bondye a Schadrac, Méschac, ak Abed-Nego a, li va chire mòso an mòso, e lakay pa li va redwi a yon pil ranblè, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:47">Dan 2:47</ref> </char></note>nanpwen lòt dye ki kapab delivre konsa.”<verse eid="DAN 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30"/>Answit, wa a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:49">Dan 2:49</ref> </char></note>fè Schadrac, Méschac ak Abed-Nego vin pwospere nan pwovens Babylone nan.<verse eid="DAN 3:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1"/>Nebucadnetsar, wa a</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="DAN 4:1">a tout pèp yo, nasyon ak lang, ki rete sou tout tè a:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="DAN 4:1">“Ke lapè nou kapab vin anpil!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:17">Éz 4:17</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2"/>Li te sanble bon pou mwen deklare sign ak mèvèy ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:26">Dan 3:26</ref> </char></note> Bondye Pi Wo a te fè pou mwen yo.<verse eid="DAN 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3"/>A la gran, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 77:19">Sòm 77:19</ref></char></note>sign Li yo gran!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">A la pwisan, mèvèy Li yo pwisan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">Wayòm Li se yon wayòm k ap dire jis pou tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">epi dominasyon li de jenerasyon an jenerasyon.<verse eid="DAN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4"/>Mwen, Nebucadnetsar, mwen te alèz nan lakay mwen e mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 30:6">Sòm 30:6</ref> </char></note>t ap pwospere nan palè mwen an. <verse eid="DAN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5"/>Mwen te fè yon rèv e li te fè m gen gwo laperèz; epi refleksyon sila yo sou kabann mwen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:1-28">Dan 2:1-28</ref> </char></note>vizyon yo nan panse m te fè m gen gwo laperèz. <verse eid="DAN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6"/>Konsa, mwen te pase lòd pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8">Jen 41:8</ref> </char></note>mennen devan prezans mwen tout mesye saj Babylone yo, pou yo ta ka fè m konnen entèpretasyon a rèv la. <verse eid="DAN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7"/>Epi majisyen yo, mèt zetwal yo, Kaldeyen yo ak divinò yo te antre e mwen te pale yo rèv la, men yo pa t ka fè m konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:25">És 44:25</ref> </char></note>entèpretasyon li. <verse eid="DAN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8"/>Men finalman, Daniel te antre devan m, ke non li te Beltschatsar, selon non dye pa mwen an e nan sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:9-18">Dan 4:9-18</ref> </char></note>lespri a dye sen yo ye a. Mwen te pale rèv la a li menm, e te di:<verse eid="DAN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9"/>O Beltschatsar, chèf majisyen yo, akoz mwen konnen ke lespri a dye sen yo nan ou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:3">Éz 28:3</ref></char></note>nanpwen mistè ki difisil pou ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:15">Jen 41:15</ref> </char></note>fè m konnen vizyon a rèv mwen ke m te fè yo, ansanm ak entèpretasyon li. <verse eid="DAN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10"/>Alò, men vizyon ki te nan tèt mwen pandan mwen kouche sou kabann mwen an: Mwen t ap gade e vwala, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:3-6">Éz 31:3-6</ref> </char></note>bwa nan mitan tè a, e wotè l te byen gran. <verse eid="DAN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11"/>Bwa a te grandi byen gwo, e li te vin fò epi wotè l te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:1">Det 9:1</ref> </char></note>rive jis nan syèl la. Li te vizib jis rive nan dènye pwent a tout tè a. <verse eid="DAN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12"/>Fèy li te byen bèl, fwi li te anpil e nan li, te gen manje pou tout moun. Bèt chan yo te jwenn lonbraj anba li, epi zwazo nan syèl yo te rete sou branch li, epi tout kreyati vivan yo te jwenn manje yo ladann.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:6">Jr 27:6</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13"/>Mwen t ap gade vizyon yo nan panse m, sou kabann mwen an, epi vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:2">Det 33:2</ref> </char></note>yon ki sen k ap veye te desann soti nan syèl la. <verse eid="DAN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14"/>Li te kriye fò e te pale konsa: Koupe bwa a, e retire branch li yo! Retire tout fèy li, e gaye fwi li yo! Kite bèt yo ale soti anba l ak zwazo yo soti sou branch li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 31:10-14">Éz 31:10-14</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="DAN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15"/>Sepandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:7-9">Job 14:7-9</ref> </char></note>kite chouk la rete anrasine nan tè a, menm avèk yon bann an fè ak bwonz k ap ansèkle l nan zèb nèf chan an. Kite moun sa a tranpe ak lawouze syèl la. Kite li pataje zèb la avèk bèt chan latè yo. <verse eid="DAN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16"/>Kite kè li vin chanje pou l pa kè moun ankò, men ke kè a yon bèt vin bay a li menm. Konsa, kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:23-32">Dan 4:23-32</ref> </char></note>sèt epòk vin pase sou li.<verse eid="DAN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17"/>Dekrèt sa a se dekrè a sila ki t ap veye yo, epi desizyon sa a se yon lòd a sila ki sen yo, pou tout sila k ap viv yo kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:16">Sòm 9:16</ref></char></note>konnen, ke Pi Wo a se chèf sou wayòm a lèzòm, epi Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:5-7">Jr 27:5-7</ref> </char></note> bay li a nenpòt moun Li pito, epi Li va ranje bay li sou moun ki pi ba yo.<verse eid="DAN 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18"/>Sa se rèv ke mwen menm, Nebucadnetsar, te fè. Alò, ou menm, Beltschatsar, ou fè m konnen entèpretasyon li, kòmsi nanpwen lòt moun pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8-15">Jen 41:8-15</ref> </char></note>mesye saj wayòm mwen yo ki kapab fè m konnen entèpretasyon an. Men ou menm, ou kapab, paske lespri a dye sen yo nan ou.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19"/>Konsa Daniel, ki rele Beltschatsar, te vin bèbè pandan yon ti tan e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:19">Jr 4:19</ref></char></note>refleksyon li yo te fè l pè. Wa a te reponn e te di: “Beltschatsar, pa kite rèv la, ni entèpretasyon li twouble ou.”</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="DAN 4:19">Beltschatsar te reponn: “Senyè mwen, pito ke rèv la te apatyen a sila ki rayi ou yo, e entèpretasyon li a lènmi ou yo! <verse eid="DAN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:10-12">Dan 4:10-12</ref> </char></note>Pyebwa ke ou te wè a, ki te vin gran, e te vin fò a, wotè a sila ki te rive jis nan syèl la, e te vizib a tout tè a; <verse eid="DAN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21"/>epi fèy a sila ki te bèl, fwi anpil la, pyebwa nan sila te gen manje pou tout moun nan, pyebwa anba sila bèt chan yo te viv la, e sou branch a sila zwazo syèl yo te vin poze a— <verse eid="DAN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22"/>se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:7">II Sam 12:7</ref> </char></note>ou menm, O wa! Paske ou te vin gran, e ou te vin fò; epi majeste ou te vin gran rive jis nan syèl la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:6">Jr 27:6</ref>,<ref loc="JER 27:7">7</ref></char></note>dominasyon ou jis rive nan dènye pwent latè.<verse eid="DAN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23"/>“Epi tandiske wa a te wè yon ki t ap veye, yon ki sen, ki t ap desann kite syèl la, e ki t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:14-15">Dan 4:14-15</ref> </char></note>‘Koupe bwa a e detwi li; sepandan, kite chouk la ak rasin li nan tè a, menm avèk yon bann fè ak bwonz k ap ansèkle li nan zèb nèf nan chan an, kite li menm moun nan tranpe ak lawouze syèl la, e kite li pataje li ak bèt chan yo jiskaske sèt epòk vin pase sou li,’<verse eid="DAN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24"/>“Sa se entèpretasyon an, O wa, e sa se dekrè a Pi Wo a ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:11-12">Job 40:11-12</ref> </char></note>vin rive sou senyè mwen an, wa a: <verse eid="DAN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25"/>Ke ou va chase ale lwen de moun, ou va rete ak bèt chan, yo va fè ou manje zèb tankou bèf, e ou va tranpe ak lawouze syèl la. Epi sèt epòk va vin pase sou ou jiskaske ou vin rekonèt ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:18">Sòm 83:18</ref></char></note>Pi Wo a se chèf sou wayòm a lèzòm, e Li bay li a sila ke Li pito. <verse eid="DAN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26"/>Epi, tandiske li te kòmande pou kite chouk la, ak rasin pyebwa a, wayòm ou an va asire apre ou vin rekonèt ke se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:18-44">Dan 2:18-44</ref> </char></note>syèl la ki renye. <verse eid="DAN 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27"/>Akoz sa, O wa, ke konsèy mwen an kapab fè ou kontan: Sispann koulye a, peche ou yo. Ranplase yo ak ladwati, e inikite ou yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:1-3">Sòm 41:1-3</ref> </char></note>montre mizerikòd a malere yo. Petèt konsa, kapab genyen yon pwolonjman trankilite ou.”<verse eid="DAN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28"/>Tout sa te vin rive a Nebucadnetsar, wa a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Nonb 23:19</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="DAN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:9">II Pi 3:9</ref> </char></note>Douz mwa pita, li t ap mache sou twati palè wa a Babylone. <verse eid="DAN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30"/>Wa a te reflechi e te di: “Èske se pa Gran Babylone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Eb 2:4</ref> </char></note>sa a, ke m te bati kon yon rezidans wayal pa fòs pouvwa mwen an, e pou glwa a pwòp majeste mwen an?”<verse eid="DAN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31"/>Pandan pawòl sa te toujou nan bouch a wa a, yon vwa te sòti nan syèl la e te di: “Wa Nebucadnetsar, a ou menm sa deklare; ‘Wayòm nan rache soti nan men ou. <verse eid="DAN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32"/>Ou va chase ale lwen de moun e plas ou pou rete va avèk bèt chan yo. Yo va fè ou manje zèb tankou bèf e sèt epòk a va pase sou ou jiskaske ou rekonèt ke Pi Wo a se chèf sou tout wayòm a lèzòm e Li bay li a nenpòt moun ke Li pito.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:25">Dan 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:16">Dan 4:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33"/>Lapoula, pawòl konsènan Nebucadnetsar a te vin akonpli. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:25">Dan 4:25</ref> </char></note>chase ale lwen de moun, li te kòmanse manje zèb tankou bèf, kò l te tranpe ak lawouze syèl la jiskaske cheve li te vin gran kon plim a yon èg, e zong li kon zong a yon zwazo.<verse eid="DAN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34"/>Men lè tan sa a te fini, mwen menm, Nebucadnetsar, mwen te leve zye m vè syèl la, bon konprann mwen te retounen sou mwen. Mwen te beni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:2">Dan 4:2</ref></char></note>Pi Wo a, mwen te louwe e mwen te bay omaj a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:24-27">Sòm 102:24-27</ref></char></note>Sila ki vivan jis pou tout tan an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:34">Paske règn Li se yon règn ki dire pou tout tan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:34">epi wayòm Li de jenerasyon an jenerasyon.<verse eid="DAN 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35"/>Tout sila ki rete sou latè yo pa konte pou anyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:11">Sòm 33:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 42:2">Job 42:2</ref></char></note>Li fè selon volonte Li nan lame syèl la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">e pami sila ki rete sou latè yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">epi nanpwen moun ki ka evite men Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">ni mande Li: “Kisa Ou fè la a?”<verse eid="DAN 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36"/>Nan lè sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:12">II Kwo 33:12</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 33:13">13</ref> </char></note>bon konprann mwen te retounen sou mwen. Epi majeste ak mayifisans mwen te restore a mwen menm pou glwa a wayòm mwen an. Konsa, konseye mwen yo ak prens mwen yo te kòmanse chache twouve mwen. Mwen te retabli nan wayòm mwen, e pi bon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:4">Pwov 22:4</ref></char></note>pi gwo pwisans te vin ogmante sou mwen. <verse eid="DAN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37"/>Alò, mwen menm Nebucadnetsar, mwen fè lwanj, egzaltasyon ak lonè a Wa syèl la, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:4">Det 32:4</ref></char></note>tout zèv Li yo vrè, chemen Li yo jis e Li kapab imilye sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:11">Egz 18:11</ref> </char></note>mache ak ògèy yo.<verse eid="DAN 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1"/>Belschatsar, wa a te fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:3">Est 1:3</ref> </char></note>gran fèt pou yon milye nan gwo chèf li yo, e li t ap bwè diven nan prezans a milye a gwo chèf yo. <verse eid="DAN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2"/>Lè Belschatsar te goute diven an, li te pase lòd pou pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">II Wa 24:13</ref> </char></note>veso fèt an lò ak ajan ke Nebucadnetsar, papa li, te retire nan tanp ki te Jérusalem yo, pou wa a ak prens li yo, madanm li yo ak ti mennaj li yo ta kapab bwè nan yo. <verse eid="DAN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3"/>Konsa, yo te mennen veso fèt an lò ki te sòti nan tanp lan, lakay Bondye ki te Jérusalem nan. Epi wa a ak prens li yo, madanm li yo ak ti mennaj li yo te bwè nan yo. <verse eid="DAN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4"/>Yo te bwè diven an e te louwe dye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4">Sòm 115:4</ref> </char></note>lò, ak ajan, bwonz, fè, bwa ak wòch yo.<verse eid="DAN 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5"/>Sibitman, men a yon moun te vin parèt. Li te kòmanse ekri anfas chandelye sou randisaj miray palè a Wa a, e wa a te wè pati nan men ki t ap ekri a. <verse eid="DAN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6"/>Konsa, figi a wa a te vin blanchi, refleksyon li yo te fè l gen gwo laperèz; jwen ren li te vin pèdi fòs e jenou li te kòmanse souke jiskaske youn t ap frape kont lòt.<verse eid="DAN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7"/>Wa a te rele byen fò pou yo mennen mèt zetwal yo, Kaldeyen ak divinò yo. Wa a te pale e te di a mesye saj Babylone yo: “Nenpòt moun ki ka li enskripsyon sa a e eksplike entèpretasyon li, li va abiye an mov, resevwa yon kolye an lò nan kou li, e vin jwenn pozisyon kon twazyèm chèf nan peyi a.”<verse eid="DAN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8"/>Alò, tout moun nan mesye saj a wa yo te antre, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8">Jen 41:8</ref> </char></note>yo pa t ka li enskripsyon an ni fè wa a konnen sa li vle di. <verse eid="DAN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9"/>Epi wa Belschatsar te plen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:11">Job 18:11</ref> </char></note>gwo laperèz, figi li te vin pi pal e prens li yo te vin twouble.<verse eid="DAN 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10"/>Rèn nan te antre nan kay bankè a akoz pawòl a wa a ak prens li yo. Rèn nan te pale e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:9">Dan 3:9</ref> </char></note>“O wa, viv jis pou tout tan! Pa kite refleksyon ou yo fè ou pè, ni figi ou vin pal. <verse eid="DAN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11"/>Gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:11-15">Jen 41:11-15</ref></char></note>nonm nan wayòm ou a, nan li menm twouve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:8">Dan 4:8</ref> </char></note>lespri a dye sen yo; epi nan jou a papa ou yo, limyè, bon konprann, ak sajès tankou sajès a dye yo te twouve nan li. Epi Wa Nebucadnetsar, papa ou, Wa a, te chwazi li chèf sou majisyen yo, mèt zetwal yo, Kaldeyen ak divinò yo. <verse eid="DAN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12"/>Se te akoz yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:14">Dan 5:14</ref> </char></note>lespri ekstrawòdinè, konesans, bon konprann, entèpretasyon a rèv yo, eksplikasyon a fraz ki nwa ak kapasite pou rezoud pwoblèm difisil. Tout sa te twouve nan Daniel sila a, ke wa a te rele Beltschatsar. Kounye a, kite yo rele Daniel e li va fè deklarasyon a entèpretasyon an.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13"/>Konsa, Daniel te mennen devan wa a. Wa a te pale e te di a Daniel: “Èske ou se menm Daniel ki te youn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 4:1">Éz 4:1</ref> </char></note>egzile a Juda yo, ke papa mwen, wa a, te mennen soti Juda a? <verse eid="DAN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14"/>Alò, mwen te tande de ou menm, ke lespri a dye yo nan ou, ke konesans, bon konprann ak sajès ki depase tout moun twouve nan ou. <verse eid="DAN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15"/>Epi koulye a, mesye saj yo, mèt zetwal yo te mennen devan m pou yo ta ka li enskripsyon sa a e fè entèpretasyon an vin konnen a mwen menm, men yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:12">És 47:12</ref> </char></note>pa t ka deklare entèpretasyon a mesaj la. <verse eid="DAN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16"/>Men mwen te tande konsènan ou menm, ke ou kapab bay entèpretasyon, e rezoud pwoblèm difisil. Alò, si ou kapab li enskripsyon an, e fè mwen konnen entèpretasyon an, ou va abiye an mov, pote yon kolye an lò nan kou ou e ou va gen otorite kon twazyèm chèf nan wayòm nan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:8">Jen 40:8</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17"/>Daniel te reponn e te di devan wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:16">II Wa 5:16</ref> </char></note>“Kenbe kado ou yo pou ou menm, oswa bay rekonpans ou yo a yon lòt moun. Sepandan, mwen va li enskripsyon an pou wa a, e fè l konnen lentèpretasyon an.<verse eid="DAN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18"/>“O wa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:2">Dan 4:2</ref></char></note> Bondye Pi Wo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:37">Dan 2:37</ref> </char></note>te bay souverènte, grandè ak glwa a Nebucadnetsar, papa ou. <verse eid="DAN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19"/>Akoz grandè ke Li te bay li a, tout pèp yo, nasyon ak lang yo te gen lakrent li, e te tranble devan l. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:12-13">Dan 2:12-13</ref> </char></note>Nenpòt moun li te pito, li te touye l, e nenpòt moun li te pito, li te lese l viv. Epi nenpòt moun li te pito, li te leve l e nenpòt moun li te pito, li te imilye l. <verse eid="DAN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20"/>Men lè kè l te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:17">Egz 9:17</ref></char></note>vin egzalte wo, lespri li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:4">II Wa 17:4</ref> </char></note>tèlman ògeye, ke li te aji ak awogans, li te depoze de twòn wayal li a, e glwa li a te rache soti nan men l. <verse eid="DAN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21"/>Anplis, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 30:3-7">Job 30:3-7</ref> </char></note>chase lwen de lòm, kè l te vin transfòme kon kè a bèt, e li te vin rete ak bourik mawon. Yo te fè li manje zèb kon bèf, e kò l te tranpe ak lawouze syèl la jiskaske li te vin rekonèt Bondye Pi Wo a se chèf sou wayòm a lèzòm, e ke li mete chèf sou li sila ke Li pito.<verse eid="DAN 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22"/>“Malgre sa, ou menm, fis li a, Belschatsar <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:3">Egz 10:3</ref> </char></note>pa t imilye kè ou, malgre ou te konnen tout sa, <verse eid="DAN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23"/>men ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:10">II Wa 14:10</ref></char></note>egzalte tèt ou kont Senyè syèl la. Konsa, yo te mennen veso lakay Li yo devan ou e ou menm ak prens ou yo, madanm ou yo, ak ti mennaj ou yo t ap bwè diven nan yo. Ou te bay lwanj a dye a ajan, lò, bwonz, fè, bwa, ak wòch yo, ki pa wè, tande, ni konprann. Men Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:10">Job 12:10</ref> </char></note>nan men a Sila souf lavi ou ye a, pou Sila tout chemen ou yo ye a, ou pa t bay Li glwa. <verse eid="DAN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24"/>Konsa, men an te voye devan l, e sa se enskripsyon ki te byen ekri a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:5">Dan 5:5</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25"/>“Alò, sa se enskripsyon ki te byen ekri a: ‘MENE, MENE, TEKEL, UPHARSIN.’<verse eid="DAN 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26"/>“Sa se entèpretasyon a mesaj la: ‘MENE’—Bondye te konte wayòm ou an e te mete fen a li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:6">És 13:6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 13:17-19">17-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27"/>‘TEKEL’—ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:6">Job 31:6</ref> </char></note>peze sou balans e ou te manke.<verse eid="DAN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28"/>‘PERES’—wayòm ou an vin divize, e li va bay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:17">És 13:17</ref> </char></note> moun Mèd ak Pès yo.”<verse eid="DAN 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29"/>Konsa, Belschatsar te pase lòd pou yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:7-16">Dan 5:7-16</ref> </char></note>abiye Daniel an mov, e mete yon kolye an lò nan kou li. Li te pibliye yon dekrè selon li ke Daniel te gen otorite kon twazyèm chèf nan wayòm nan.<verse eid="DAN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30"/>Menm nwit sa a, Belschatsar, wa Kaldeyen an te touye.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:4-9">És 21:4-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1">Dan 6:1</ref> </char></note>Darius, Mèd la, te resevwa wayòm nan ak anviwon laj swasann-de lane.<verse eid="DAN 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1"/>Li te fè Darius plezi pou chwazi san-ven satrap sou wayòm nan, pou yo ta kapab pran chaj a tout wayòm nan. <verse eid="DAN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2"/>Epi sou yo menm, twa chèf. Youn nan chèf sila yo se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:48">Dan 2:48</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 2:49">49</ref></char></note>Daniel. Satrap sila yo ta dwe responsab bay kont sou yo menm, pou wa a pa ta soufre okenn pèt. <verse eid="DAN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3"/>Daniel te kòmanse distenge li menm pami chèf ak satrap yo akoz li te posede yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:12">Dan 5:12</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 5:14">14</ref></char></note>lespri ekstrawòdinè, e wa a te fè plan pou plase li sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:40">Jen 41:40</ref> </char></note>tout wayòm nan.<verse eid="DAN 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4"/>Konsa, chèf ak satrap yo te kòmanse chache pou twouve yon koz akizasyon kont Daniel nan zafè wayòm nan; men yo pa t ka jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:22">Dan 6:22</ref> </char></note>okenn baz pou akize l, ni okenn koripsyon, akoz li te fidèl. Okenn neglijans ni koripsyon pa t ka twouve nan li. <verse eid="DAN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5"/>Epi mesye sila yo te di: “Nou p ap jwenn okenn mwayen pou fè akizasyon kont Daniel eksepte nou jwenn sa kont li konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:13-21">Trav 24:13-21</ref> </char></note>lalwa Bondye li a.”<verse eid="DAN 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6"/>Alò, chèf sila yo ak satrap yo te antann yo pou te parèt devan wa a, e te pale avèk li konsa: “Wa Darius, viv jis pou tout tan!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:3">Né 2:3</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="DAN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7"/>Tout chèf wayòm ak prefè yo, satrap yo, wo ofisyèl ak gouvènè yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 59:3">Sòm 59:3</ref></char></note>fè konsiltasyon ansanm pou wa a ta etabli yon estati e fè yon dekrè pou nenpòt moun ki ta fè yon priyè a yon lòt dye oswa lòm sof ke ou menm pandan trant jou, o wa, dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:9">Sòm 10:9</ref> </char></note>jete nan fòs lyon an. <verse eid="DAN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8"/>Alò, O wa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:12">Est 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="EST 1:19">Est 1:19</ref> </char></note>fè dekrè a e siyen dokiman pou l pa ka chanje selon lalwa Mèd ak Pès yo, ki p ap ka chanje.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9"/>Konsa Darius, wa a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:9">Sòm 118:9</ref> </char></note>siyen dokiman an, ak dekrè a.<verse eid="DAN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10"/>Alò, lè Daniel te konnen ke dokiman an te fin siyen, li te lantre lakay li (alò, nan chanm anwo a, te gen fenèt ki te ouvri vè Jérusalem), epi li te mete li sou jenou li twa fwa pa jou, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:4-19">Dan 9:4-19</ref></char></note>fè lapriyè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:1">Sòm 34:1</ref> </char></note>bay remèsiman devan Bondye li a, jan li te kon fè oparavan an. <verse eid="DAN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11"/>Alò, mesye sila yo te reyini ansanm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:32-33">Sòm 37:32-33</ref> </char></note> e yo te vin jwenn Daniel ki t ap fè petisyon ak siplikasyon li devan Bondye li a. <verse eid="DAN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12"/>Konsa, yo te pwoche pou te pale devan wa a konsènan dekrè a: “Èske ou pa t siyen yon dekrè ke yon moun ki ta fè petisyon a yon lòt dye oswa lòm sof ke ou menm, O wa, pandan trant jou, ta vin jete nan fòs lyon an?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Wa a te reponn: “Pawòl sa a se verite, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:19">Est 1:19</ref> </char></note>Lalwa a Mèd ak Pès yo, ki p ap ka chanje menm.”<verse eid="DAN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13"/>Epi yo te reponn, e te pale devan wa a: “Daniel, ki se youn nan egzile ki soti Juda yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:8">Est 3:8</ref> </char></note>pa okipe ou, O wa, ni dekrè ke ou te siyen an, men kontinye fè petisyon li yo twa fwa pa jou.” <verse eid="DAN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14"/>Alò, depi wa a te fin tande pawòl sa a, li te vin byen twouble e te dirije panse li sou mwayen pou delivre Daniel. Epi jiskaske solèy fin kouche, li te kontinye fè efò pou l ta ka sove li.<verse eid="DAN 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15"/>Alò, mesye sila yo te rasanble ansanm devan wa a. Yo te di wa a: “Byen konprann, O wa, ke sa se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:8">Est 8:8</ref> </char></note>lwa a Mèd ak Pès yo, ke okenn pwosè legal, ni dekrè ke wa a ta etabli, pa kapab chanje.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16"/>Konsa, wa a te pase lòd pou mennen Daniel jete nan fos lyon an. Wa a te pale. Li te di a Daniel: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:19">Job 5:19</ref> </char></note>“Bondye ou a, ke ou sèvi san rete a, va Li menm, delivre ou.”<verse eid="DAN 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17"/>Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 3:53">Lam 3:53</ref> </char></note>wòch te mennen pou te plase sou bouch a fòs la, epi wa a te sele li ak pwòp bag so li a, e ak bag so a prens li yo, pou anyen pa ta chanje konsènan Daniel. <verse eid="DAN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18"/>Konsa, wa a te ale nan palè li e te pase nwit lan nan fè jèn. Pa t gen okenn enstriman mizik ki te pote devan l, epi somèy te kite l.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:16">II Sam 12:16</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 12:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="EST 6:1">Est 6:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19"/>Alò, wa a te leve avan solèy la, lè bajou fenk kase, e li te fè vit ale nan fòs lyon an. <verse eid="DAN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20"/>Lè li te vin pre fòs kote Daniel la, li te kriye fò ak yon vwa byen twouble. Wa a te pale e te di a Daniel: “Daniel, sèvitè a Bondye vivan an, èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Jen 18:14</ref></char></note>Bondye ou a, ke ou sèvi san rete a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:16">Dan 6:16</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 6:27">27</ref> </char></note>te gen kapasite pou delivre ou de lyon yo?”<verse eid="DAN 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21"/>Konsa, Daniel te reponn a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref> </char></note>“O wa, viv jis pou tout tan! <verse eid="DAN 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22"/>Bondye mwen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-13">Sòm 91:11-13</ref></char></note>te voye zanj li. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:16">Nonb 20:16</ref></char></note>te fèmen bouch a lyon yo e yo pa t fè m okenn mal, paske, mwen te twouve inosan devan l, e anplis, anvè ou menm, O wa a, mwen pa t fè okenn krim.”<verse eid="DAN 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23"/>Wa a te vrèman kontan e te pase lòd pou Daniel ta retire nan fòs la. Konsa, Daniel te vin retire nan fòs la e okenn blesi pa t menm twouve sou li, akoz li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:20">I Kwo 5:20</ref> </char></note>mete konfyans nan Bondye li a.<verse eid="DAN 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24"/>Konsa, wa a te pase lòd pou yo te mennen mesye sila ki te aji ak movèz fwa, pou akize Daniel yo, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:18">Det 19:18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 19:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:16">Det 24:16</ref> </char></note>jete yo menm, pitit yo ak madanm yo nan fòs lyon an. Konsa, yo pa t menm rive nan baz fòs la avan lyon yo te sezi yo e te kraze tout zo yo.<verse eid="DAN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25"/>Epi Darius, wa a te ekri a tout pèp yo, nasyon ak lang ki t ap viv nan tout peyi a:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="DAN 6:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:17">Esd 4:17</ref> </char>
    </note>“Ke lapè ou kapab vin miltipliye!<verse eid="DAN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26"/>Mwen fè yon dekrè ke nan tout dominasyon wayòm mwen an, pou tout moun gen pou gen lakrent e tranble devan Dye Daniel la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">Paske Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:34">Dan 4:34</ref></char></note>Bondye vivan an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 93:1">Sòm 93:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 93:2">2</ref></char></note>dire jis pou tout tan an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">epi wayòm Li an se yon wayòm ki p ap janm detwi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">Règn li an va jis pou tout tan.<verse eid="DAN 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27"/>Li delivre e Li sove,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:27">Li fè sign ak mèvèy nan syèl la ak sou tè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:27">Li menm ki te delivre Daniel soti nan pouvwa a lyon yo.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:2-3">Dan 4:2-3</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28"/>Konsa, Daniel sila a te vin pwospere pandan règn a Darius la, e pandan règn a Cyrus, Pès la.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:22">II Kwo 36:22</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 6:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1"/>Nan premye ane Belschatsar, wa Babylone nan, Daniel te fè yon rèv ak vizyon nan panse li, sou kabann li. Epi li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:4">Jr 36:4</ref> </char></note>ekri rèv la e te rakonte bagay prensipal yo.<verse eid="DAN 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2"/>Daniel te di: “Mwen t ap gade nan vizyon mwen pandan nwit lan; epi vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:1">Rev 7:1</ref> </char></note>kat van syèl yo t ap boulvèse gwo lanmè a. <verse eid="DAN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3"/>Epi kat gran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref> </char></note>bèt t ap monte soti nan lanmè a, youn pa t sanble lòt.<verse eid="DAN 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4"/>“Premye a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:7">Jr 4:7</ref> </char></note>tankou yon lyon e li te gen zèl a èg. Mwen te gade jiskaske plim li yo te vin rache, epi li te leve kite tè a ,pou l te fèt vin kanpe sou de pye kon yon moun. Anplis, li te resevwa kè a yon moun.<verse eid="DAN 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5"/>“Konsa, vwala, yon lòt bèt, yon dezyèm, ki te sanble ak yon lous. Li te vin leve nan yon bò e twa zo kòt te nan bouch li nan dan li. Konsa, yo te di a li: ‘Leve, devore anpil vyann!’<verse eid="DAN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6"/>“Apre sa, mwen te kontinye gade e vwala, yon lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:2">Rev 13:2</ref></char></note>tankou yon leyopa, ki te gen sou do li kat zèl a yon zwazo. Bèt sa, anplis, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:22">Dan 8:22</ref> </char></note>kat tèt, e dominasyon te vin bay a li menm.<verse eid="DAN 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7"/>“Apre sa, mwen te kontinye gade nan vizyon nwit lan e vwala, yon katriyèm bèt, byen tèrib, pwisan e fò depase. Li te gen gwo dan fèt an fè. Li te devore, kraze e foule tout sa ki te rete anba pye li. Li te diferan de tout lòt bèt ki te parèt avan li yo. Li te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:3">Rev 12:3</ref> </char></note>dis kòn.<verse eid="DAN 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8"/>“Pandan mwen t ap reflechi sou kòn yo, vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:9">Dan 8:9</ref></char></note>yon lòt kòn, yon ti piti, te vin leve pami yo, e twa nan premye kòn yo te rache pa rasin yo. Epi vwala, kòn sila a te gen zye tankou zye a moun, e yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:5">Rev 13:5</ref>,<ref loc="REV 13:6">6</ref> </char></note>bouch ki te eksprime anpil bagay ak gwo awogans.<verse eid="DAN 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9"/>“Mwen te kontinye gade jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">Rev 20:4</ref></char></note>twòn yo te vin plase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Epi youn ki te Ansyen de Jou Yo te chita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Abiman Li te tankou lanèj blan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">e cheve nan tèt Li te tankou lenn san tach.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Twòn Li te briyan akoz flanm yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">e wou li yo te yon dife ki t ap brile.<verse eid="DAN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10"/>Yon rivyè dife t ap koule pou l vin parèt devan L;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Milye dè milye t ap okipe L.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Di-mil fwa di-mil te kanpe devan L.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Jijman an te etabli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Liv yo te vin ouvri.<verse eid="DAN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11"/>“Alò, mwen te kontinye gade, akoz son a pawòl awogan ke kòn nan t ap pale yo. Mwen te kontinye gade jiskaske bèt la te vin touye, kò l te detwi, e li te vin bay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:20">Rev 19:20</ref> </char></note>dife ki t ap brile a. <verse eid="DAN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12"/>Pou tout lòt bèt yo, dominasyon yo te vin retire, men yo te resevwa yon pwolongasyon lavi pandan yon sezon ak pandan yon tan.<verse eid="DAN 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13"/>“Mwen te kontinye gade nan vizyon nwit lan, epi vwala, la te vini ak nwaj syèl yo, yon moun tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref> </char></note>Fis a Lòm t ap vini; epi Li te vin parèt devan Ansyen A Jou Yo e te fè l vin prè. <verse eid="DAN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14"/>A li menm, Li te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:27">Dan 7:27</ref> </char></note>dominasyon, glwa a, ak yon wayòm, pou tout pèp, nasyon ak lang yo ta ka sèvi Li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:7">Mi 4:7</ref></char></note>Dominasyon Li an se yon dominasyon k ap dire jis pou tout tan, ki p ap janm fini. Epi wayòm Li an se yon wayòm ki p ap detwi.<verse eid="DAN 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15"/>“Pou mwen menm, Daniel, lespri mwen te twouble anndan mwen, e vizyon nan panse m yo te kontinye ban m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:19">Dan 4:19</ref> </char></note>gwo laperèz. <verse eid="DAN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16"/>Mwen te pwoche youn nan sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:9-19">Za 1:9-19</ref></char></note>kanpe akote yo, e te kòmanse mande li kisa tout sa te vle di.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 7:16">“Konsa, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref> </char></note>eksplike mwen e te fè m konnen byen dirèk entèpretasyon a tout bagay sa yo. <verse eid="DAN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17"/>‘Gwo bèt sila yo, ki se kat yo, se kat wa ki va leve soti nan tè a. <verse eid="DAN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18"/>Men sen yo a Sila Ki Pi Wo a, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 149:5-9">Sòm 149:5-9</ref> </char></note>resevwa wayòm nan, e va posede wayòm nan jis pou tout tan, pou tout laj ki gen pou vini yo.’<verse eid="DAN 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19"/>“Epi mwen te dezire konnen kisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7-8">Dan 7:7-8</ref> </char></note>Katriyèm bèt la te sinyifi, ki pa t menm jan ak lòt bèt yo, te vrèman tèrib, ak dan li an fè, e grif li an bwonz, ki te devore, kraze e foule rès la anba pye li; <verse eid="DAN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20"/>epi kisa dis kòn sou tèt li yo ak lòt kòn ki te vin leve a te sinyifi, e devan sila twa nan yo te tonbe a, menm kòn ki te gen zye ak bouch ki te pi djanam nan aparans ke parèy li yo. <verse eid="DAN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21"/>Mwen te kontinye gade; kòn sa a t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">Rev 11:7</ref> </char></note>fè lagè ak fidèl yo, e te enpoze li sou yo. <verse eid="DAN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22"/>Jiskaske Ansyen A Jou Yo te vini, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan 7:10</ref> </char></note>jijman an te fèt nan favè a sen a Sila Ki Pi Wo a e lè a te rive pou sen yo te pran posesyon a wayòm nan.<verse eid="DAN 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23"/>“Konsa, li te di: ‘Katriyèm bèt la va yon katriyèm wayòm sou latè, ki va apa de tout lòt wayòm yo. Li va devore tout latè, mache sou li e kraze li an mòso. <verse eid="DAN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24"/>E pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref> </char></note>dis kòn yo, sòti nan wayòm sa a, dis wa va leve. Konsa, yon lòt va leve apre yo, li p ap menm jan ak lòt ki te avan yo, e li va kraze twa wa yo. <verse eid="DAN 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25"/>Li va pale kont Pi Wo a, li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:7">Rev 13:7</ref></char></note>epwize sen a Sila Ki Pi Wo a, epi li va gen entansyon pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:21">Dan 2:21</ref> </char></note>fè chanjman nan tan ak lwa yo. Yo va vin livre nan men li pandan yon tan ak tan yo, ak yon mwatye tan.<verse eid="DAN 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26"/>“‘Men jijman an va etabli. Dominasyon li an va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:4">Rev 17:4</ref> </char></note>rache, anile e detwi jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="DAN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27"/>Epi wayòm a dominasyon an, ak grandè a tout wayòm yo anba tout syèl la va vin livre a pèp a sen a Pi Wo yo. Wayòm Li an, yon wayòm k ap dire jis pou tout tan e tout dominasyon yo va sèvi e obeyi Li.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:3">És 54:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:6-12">Sòm 2:6-12</ref> </char></note><verse eid="DAN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28"/>“Se konsa bagay la te fini. Pou mwen menm, Daniel, refleksyon mwen yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:19">Dan 4:19</ref></char></note>twouble m anpil anpil, e figi m te vin pal; men mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:19">Luc 2:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 2:51">51</ref> </char></note>kenbe bagay la nan kè m.”<verse eid="DAN 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1"/>Nan twazyèm ane règn a Belschatsar a, wa a, yon vizyon te parèt a mwen menm, Daniel, apre sa ki parèt a mwen an premye a. <verse eid="DAN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2"/>Mwen te gade nan vizyon an e pandan mwen t ap gade a, mwen te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:1">Né 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:22">Jen 10:22</ref> </char></note>Suse, palè ki nan pwovens Élam nan. Epi mwen te gade nan vizyon an, e mwen te bò Kanal Ulaï la. <verse eid="DAN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3"/>Mwen te leve zye m pou te gade e vwala, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:20">Dan 8:20</ref> </char></note>belye ak de kòn ki te kanpe devan kanal la. Alò, de kòn yo te long, men youn te pi long ke lòt la, e sa ki pi long lan ki te leve an dènye. <verse eid="DAN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4"/>Mwen te wè belye a ki t ap frape tèt li vè lwès, vè nò e vè sid. Pa t gen bèt ki te ka kanpe devan l, ni pa t gen youn ki te kab delivre soti anba men li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:3">Dan 11:3</ref> </char></note> Men li te fè sa li te pito, e te leve tèt li Wo.<verse eid="DAN 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5"/>Pandan mwen t ap gade a, vwala yon mal kabrit t ap vini soti nan lwès sou fas tout tè a, san touche tè a, e kabrit la te gen yon kòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:8-21">Dan 8:8-21</ref> </char></note>parèt byen klè antre zye li. <verse eid="DAN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6"/>Li te pwoche kote belye ki te gen de kòn nan, belye ke m te wè kanpe devan kanal la, e li te kouri fò sou li ak gwo chalè pwisans li. <verse eid="DAN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7"/>Mwen te wè li vin bò kote belye a e li te anraje sou li. Epi li te frape belye a. Li te kraze de kòn li yo, e belye a pa t gen fòs pou reziste ak li. Konsa, li te voye l a tè, e te ponpe sou li. Pa t gen moun ki pou delivre belye a devan pouvwa li. <verse eid="DAN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8"/>Epi kabrit mal la te agrandi pouvwa li anpil, anpil. Men depi li te vin pwisan an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:22">Dan 8:22</ref> </char></note>pi gwo kòn nan te kase. Epi li te ranplase ak kat kòn, ki parèt byen klè, ki te sòti vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:2">Dan 7:2</ref> </char></note>kat van syèl yo.<verse eid="DAN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9"/>Youn nan kòn yo te parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:23">Dan 8:23</ref></char></note>yon ti jan piti e li te grandi byen vit vè sid, vè lès e vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:2">Sòm 48:2</ref> </char></note> peyi laglwa a. <verse eid="DAN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10"/>Li te grandi rive jis nan lame syèl la. Li te fè kèk nan lame a ak kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13">És 14:13</ref> </char></note>zetwal yo tonbe atè, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref></char></note>ponpe sou yo. <verse eid="DAN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11"/>Li te menm agrandi pwòp tèt li pou l ta ka egal ak Chèf Tèt lame syèl la. Konsa, li te retire nan men l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 46:14">Éz 46:14</ref> </char></note>sakrifis nòmal la, e plas sanktyè Li a te jete anba. <verse eid="DAN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12"/>Epi akoz transgresyon, lame a va vin livre a kòn nan ansanm ak sakrifis nòmal la. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:14">És 59:14</ref> </char></note>voye verite a jis atè, e sa te fè plezi, e li te pwospere.<verse eid="DAN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13"/>Alò, mwen te tande sila ki sen an ap pale, e yon lòt ki sen te di a sila ki t ap pale a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:10">Sòm 74:10</ref> </char></note>“Pandan konbyen tan vizyon a sakrifis nòmal la va kontinye, pandan transgresyon an ap ravaje e kite ni sen lye an ansanm ak lame a vin foule anba pye?”<verse eid="DAN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14"/>Li te di mwen: “Pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref> </char></note>de-mil-twa-san swa ak maten. Epi alò, sen lye a va vin pwòp ankò.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15"/>Lè mwen menm, Daniel, te fè vizyon an, mwen te chache konprann li. Epi gade byen, kanpe devan mwen se te yon bagay ki te sanble ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref> </char></note>moun. <verse eid="DAN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16"/>Mwen te tande vwa a yon moun antre de rebò kanal Ulaï la. Li te rele fò e li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:21">Dan 9:21</ref> </char></note>“Gabriel, fè nonm sa a konprann vizyon an.”<verse eid="DAN 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17"/>Konsa, li te vin toupre kote mwen te kanpe a. Lè l te parèt, mwen te gen gwo laperèz, e mwen te tonbe sou figi m. Men li te di mwen: “Fis a lòm, konprann vizyon an; paske vizyon an apatyen a bagay a dènye tan yo.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:19">Dan 8:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18"/>Alò, pandan li t ap pale avè m, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:9">Dan 10:9</ref></char></note>tonbe nan yon pwofon somèy, ak figi m atè, men li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:2">Éz 2:2</ref> </char></note>touche mwen, e te fè m kanpe dwat.<verse eid="DAN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19"/>Li te di: “Gade byen, mwen va fè ou konnen sa k ap vin rive nan dènye epòk gwo kòlè a, paske li apatyen a moman ki chwazi pou lafen an.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:15-17">Dan 8:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:3">Dan 8:3</ref> </char></note>Belye ke ou te wè ak de kòn yo reprezante wa a Mèdes ak Perse yo. <verse eid="DAN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21"/>Epi kabrit la se wayòm a Grèce la, e gran kòn antre zye li yo, se premye wa a. <verse eid="DAN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22"/>Kòn ki te kase a ak kat kòn ki te leve nan plas li a se kat wayòm ki va leve sòti nan nasyon sa a, malgre se pa avèk pouvwa li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:8">Dan 8:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23"/>“Epi nan dènye pati wayòm yo a, lè transgresè yo fin fè tout transgresyon yo, yon wa va leve ki fiwos, e plen devinèt koken. <verse eid="DAN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24"/>Pouvwa li a va trè pwisan, men se pa ak pwòp pouvwa li. Konsa, li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:11-13">Dan 8:11-13</ref> </char></note>detwi anpil ak gran pwisans. Li va gen gran siksè, e li va fè sa li pito. Li va detwi mesye pwisan ak moun ki sen yo. <verse eid="DAN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25"/>Atravè manèv li yo, se ak riz k ap avanse nan men li. Konsa, li va leve tèt li wo nan kè l, epi li va detwi anpil moun pandan yo ansekirite. Anplis, li va kanpe kont Prens dè prens yo, men li va vin kraze <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:20">Job 34:20</ref> </char></note>san èd moun.<verse eid="DAN 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26"/>“Vizyon sila a, aswè ak maten ki te pale a, se verite. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:27">Éz 12:27</ref></char></note> sele vizyon an, pou l pa pale menm, paske li apatyen a anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:14">Dan 10:14</ref> </char></note>jou ki gen pou vini.”<verse eid="DAN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27"/>Konsa, mwen menm, Daniel, te vin malad pandan plizyè jou. Lè m te leve ankò, mwen te kontinye fè zafè a wa a. Mwen te etone de vizyon an e mwen pa t gen moun ki te konprann li.<verse eid="DAN 8:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1"/>Nan premye ane <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:31">Dan 5:31</ref> </char></note>Darius, fis a Assuérus, Mèd la, ki te vin wa sou wayòm a Kaldeyen yo— <verse eid="DAN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2"/>nan premye ane a règn pa li a, mwen menm, Daniel, mwen te konprann selon liv yo, nonb dèzane selon pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Jérémie, pwofèt la, pou ta fè akonplisman dezolasyon a Jérusalem yo, menm swasann-dis ane yo. <verse eid="DAN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3"/>Konsa, mwen te chache fas Senyè Bondye a, pou jwenn Li nan lapriyè ak siplikasyon, fè jèn ak twal sak ak sann.<verse eid="DAN 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4"/>Mwen te priye a SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an. Mwen te konfese e mwen te di:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="DAN 9:4">“O SENYÈ, Gran Bondye ki etonnan la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:21">Det 7:21</ref></char></note> ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:9">Det 7:9</ref> </char></note>kenbe akò ak mizerikòd li pou sila ki renmen Li, e ki swiv kòmandman Li yo, <verse eid="DAN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5"/>nou te peche; nou te komèt inikite. Nou te aji ak mechanste e nou te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 1:18-20">Lam 1:18-20</ref></char></note>rebèl, jiskaske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:176">Sòm 119:176</ref> </char></note>vire kite kòmandman Ou yo ak règleman Ou yo. <verse eid="DAN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6"/>Anplis, nou pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">II Kwo 36:16</ref> </char></note>koute sèvitè Ou yo, pwofèt yo, ki te pale nan non Ou, a wa nou yo, prens nou yo, papa zansèt nou yo, ak tout moun peyi a.<verse eid="DAN 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:6">Jr 23:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ladwati apatyen a Ou menm, O Senyè! Men a nou menm, gwo wont parèt byen klè, jan li ye jis rive nan jou sa a; a moun Juda yo, sila k ap viv Jérusalem, ak tout Israël yo, sila ki rete pre ak sila ki lwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:27">Det 4:27</ref> </char></note>nan tout peyi kote Ou te chase yo ale akoz zak enfidèl ke yo te komèt kont Ou yo. <verse eid="DAN 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8"/>O Senyè, gwo wont ak twoub byen klè se akoz nou, ak wa nou yo, prens nou yo, ak papa zansèt nou yo, akoz yo te peche kont Ou. <verse eid="DAN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9"/>A Senyè Bondye nou an, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:17">Né 9:17</ref> </char></note>Mizerikòd ak padon akoz nou te fè rebèl kont Li. <verse eid="DAN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10"/>Ni nou pa t obeyi vwa SENYÈ Bondye nou an, pou mache nan enstriksyon ke Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13-15">II Wa 17:13-15</ref> </char></note>mete devan nou pa sèvitè Li yo, pwofèt yo. <verse eid="DAN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11"/>Anverite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:3">És 1:3</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 1:4">4</ref></char></note>tout Israël te transgrese lalwa Ou a, te vire akote e pa t obeyi vwa Ou.</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="DAN 9:11">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:15-26">Det 27:15-26</ref> </char></note>malediksyon te vide sou nou, ansanm ak sèman ki ekri nan lalwa Moïse, sèvitè Bondye a, paske nou te peche kont Li. <verse eid="DAN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12"/>Li te konfime pawòl ke Li te pale kont nou, e kont chèf ki te gouvène nou yo, pou fè vini sou nou yon gwo malè. Paske anba tout syèl la, pa t janm gen okenn bagay ki te fèt tankou sa ki te fèt Jérusalem nan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:26">És 44:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DAN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13"/>Jan sa ekri nan lalwa Moïse la, tout malè sa a te vini sou nou. Malgre sa, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:13">Job 36:13</ref></char></note>pa t chache gras a SENYÈ la, Bondye nou an, ak desizyon pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:18">Jr 31:18</ref> </char></note>vire kite inikite nou, e vin okipe nou de verite pa Ou a. <verse eid="DAN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14"/>Akoz sa, SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:28">Jr 31:28</ref> </char></note>kenbe malè nan men l, e te pote li sou nou. Paske, SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, dwat nan tout zèv ke Li fè yo, men nou pa t obeyi vwa li.<verse eid="DAN 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15"/>Konsa, Senyè, Bondye nou an, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:15">Det 5:15</ref> </char></note>mennen pèp Ou a sòti nan peyi Egypte la ak yon men pwisan, e te fè yon non pou Ou menm, jan sa ye nan jou sa a, nou te peche. Nou te fè mechanste. <verse eid="DAN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16"/>O Senyè, an akò ak tout zak ladwati Ou yo, kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:31-32">Jr 32:31-32</ref> </char></note> gwo kòlè ak mekontantman Ou vire kite vil Ou a, Jérusalem, mòn sen Ou an. Paske, akoz peche nou yo ak inikite a papa zansèt nou yo, Jérusalem ak pèp Ou a te vin yon repwòch pou tout sila ki antoure nou yo.<verse eid="DAN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17"/>Pou sa, koulye a, Bondye nou an, koute lapriyè a sèvitè Ou a, ak siplikasyon li yo, e pou koz a Ou menm, O Senyè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:24-26">Nonb 6:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:18">Lam 5:18</ref> </char></note>kite fas ou briye sou sanktiyè dezole Ou a. <verse eid="DAN 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18"/>O Bondye mwen an, apiye zòrèy W pou tande! Ouvri zye ou pou wè dezolasyon nou yo, ak vil la ki rele pa non Ou a; paske nou p ap prezante siplikasyon nou yo akoz okenn dwati de nou menm, men akoz gran mizerikòd Ou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:14">Sòm 80:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:10-12">Jr 7:10-12</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="DAN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19"/>O Senyè, koute! O Senyè, padone! O Senyè, tande e aji! Pou koz pa Ou, O Bondye mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:23">Sòm 44:23</ref> </char></note>pa fè reta. Paske vil Ou a, ak pèp Ou a rele pa non Ou.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20"/>Alò, pandan mwen t ap pale, e fè priyè a, pou m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:5">És 6:5</ref> </char></note>konfese peche m yo, ak peche a pèp mwen an, Israël, ak prezante siplikasyon mwen yo devan SENYÈ Bondye mwen an, pou mòn sen a Bondye mwen an— <verse eid="DAN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21"/>pandan mwen te toujou ap pale nan lapriyè a— alò, nonm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref> </char></note>Gabriel, ke m te wè nan vizyon oparavan an, te vole rive byen vit kote mwen, e te touche mwen vè lè pou ofrann nan aswè a. <verse eid="DAN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22"/>Li te ban mwen enstriksyon. Li te pale ak mwen e te di: “O Daniel, koulye a, mwen vin parèt pou bay sajès ak bon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref> </char></note>konprann. <verse eid="DAN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23"/>Nan kòmansman siplikasyon ou yo, lòd la te fin pase, e mwen vini pou di Ou, paske ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:11">Dan 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref> </char></note>se byeneme. Konsa, prete atansyon a mesaj la pou vin konprann vizyon an.<verse eid="DAN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24"/>“Swasann-dis semèn te òdone pou pèp ou ak vil sen ou an, pou fini ak transgresyon, pou mete fen a peche yo, pou rekonsilye inikite yo, pou mennen fè antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:24">II Kwo 29:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:6">És 51:6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 51:8">8</ref> </char></note>ladwati ki san fen, pou mete so sou vizyon ak pwofesi, e pou onksyone lye ki sen pase tout la.<verse eid="DAN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25"/>“Konsa, ou ta dwe konnen e disène ke depi yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:24">Esd 4:24</ref> </char></note>dekrè vin pibliye pou restore e rebati Jérusalem jis rive nan Onksyone a, Prens lan, va gen sèt semèn ak swasann-de semèn. Li va rebati ankò, ak plas la, e ak kanal ranpa a, menm nan yon tan ki twouble. <verse eid="DAN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26"/>Epi apre swasann-de semèn yo, Onksyone a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:8">És 53:8</ref></char></note>koupe retite nèt, e Li p ap gen anyen. E pèp a prens la ki vini an, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:2">Mat 24:2</ref> </char></note>detwi vil ak sanktyè a. Epi lafen li an va vini ak yon inondasyon ak lagè jis rive nan lafèn. Konsa, dezolasyon yo deja detèmine. <verse eid="DAN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27"/>Li va fè yon akò ki byen fò avèk anpil moun pandan yon semèn. Men nan mitan semèn nan, li va fè sispann sakrifis ak ofrann sereyal yo. Epi sou zèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:31">Dan 11:31</ref></char></note>abominasyon yo, va vini yon moun ki fè dezolasyon. Men lè l rive nan fen an nèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:23">És 10:23</ref> </char></note> ki deja detèmine, lakòlè va vide sou sila ki fè dezolasyon an.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1"/>Nan twazyèm ane Cyrus, wa Perse la, yon mesaj te revele a Daniel, ki te rele Belschatsar. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:26">Dan 8:26</ref></char></note>Mesaj la te vrè; menm yon gran gè. Li te konprann mesaj la, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:17">Dan 1:17</ref> </char></note>gen konprann vizyon an.<verse eid="DAN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2"/>Nan jou sila yo, mwen menm, Daniel, mwen t ap fè dèy pandan twa semèn. <verse eid="DAN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3"/>Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:18">Dan 6:18</ref> </char></note>pa t manje okenn bon manje; ni vyann, ni diven nan pa t antre nan bouch mwen. Ni mwen pa t sèvi okenn pomad pou onksyone jiskaske tout twa semèn sila yo te fin akonpli.<verse eid="DAN 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4"/>Nan venn-katriyèm jou nan premye mwa a, pandan mwen te akote gran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:3">Éz 1:3</ref> </char></note>rivyè a, ki se Hiddékel, <verse eid="DAN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5"/>mwen te leve zye m gade e vwala, te gen yon sèten nonm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:2">Éz 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:13">Rev 1:13</ref> </char></note>abiye an len, ak senti l mare ak yon sentiwon lò pi, ki sòti Uphaz. <verse eid="DAN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6"/>Anplis, kò li te tankou krizolit, figi li kon aparans ak loray, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:14">Rev 1:14</ref> </char></note>zye li kon tòch flanm dife, bra li ak pye li tankou bwonz byen poli, e son a pawòl li yo, kon son a yon gran foul.<verse eid="DAN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7"/>Alò, mwen menm, Daniel, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:17-20">II Wa 6:17-20</ref> </char></note>tou sèl te wè vizyon an, pandan mesye ki te avè m yo pa t wè vizyon an, men yon gwo laperèz te vin tonbe sou yo, e yo te kouri ale kache kò yo. <verse eid="DAN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8"/>Konsa, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:24">Jen 32:24</ref></char></note>rete sèl, e mwen te wè gran vizyon sila a. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:28">Dan 7:28</ref> </char></note>pa t gen fòs ki te rete nan mwen, paske koulè po m te vin pal tankou moun ki mouri, e mwen te pèdi tout fòs mwen nèt. <verse eid="DAN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9"/>Men mwen te tande son a pawòl li yo. Depi mwen te tande son pawòl li yo, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:12">Jen 15:12</ref> </char></note>tonbe nan yon gwo somèy sou figi mwen, figi m atè nèt.<verse eid="DAN 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10"/>Konsa, gade byen, yon men te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:9">Jr 1:9</ref> </char></note>touche mwen ki te plase m sou men ak jenou m yo. <verse eid="DAN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11"/>Li te di mwen: “O Daniel, nonm ki trè byeneme a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 8:17">17</ref></char></note>konprann pawòl ke mwen va pale ou yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:1">Éz 2:1</ref> </char></note>Kanpe dwat! Paske mwen te voye kote ou koulye a.” Lè li te pale pawòl sa a, mwen menm, mwen te kanpe. Mwen t ap tranble.<verse eid="DAN 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12"/>Alò, li te di mwen: “Pa pè, Daniel, paske depi premye jou ke ou te dedye kè ou pou konprann sa a, lè ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:20-23">Dan 9:20-23</ref> </char></note>imilye ou devan Bondye ou a, pawòl ou yo te vin tande. Konsa, mwen te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:30">Trav 10:30</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:31">31</ref></char></note>akoz pawòl ou yo. <verse eid="DAN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13"/>Men prens a wayòm Perse la te kanpe kont mwen pandan venteyen jou; epi gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:21">Dan 10:21</ref> </char></note>Micaël, youn nan chèf a prens yo, te vin ede m, paske mwen te rete la sèl ak wa a Perse yo. <verse eid="DAN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14"/>Koulye a, mwen gen tan vini pou bay ou konprann de sa ki va rive a pèp ou a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:29">Det 31:29</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:26">Dan 8:26</ref> </char></note>dènye jou yo, paske vizyon an apatyen a anpil jou ki poko rive.”<verse eid="DAN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15"/>Lè li te pale ak mwen konsènan pawòl sila yo, mwen te vire figi mwen vè tè a e mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:26">Éz 3:26</ref> </char></note>pa t ka pale menm. <verse eid="DAN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16"/>Epi gade byen, yon bagay ki te sanble ak yon fis a lòm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:7">És 6:7</ref></char></note>touche lèv mwen. Konsa, mwen te louvri bouch mwen pou te pale, e mwen te di a sila ki te kanpe devan m nan: “O senyè mwen an, akoz vizyon an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:15">Dan 7:15</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:28">28</ref> </char></note>chagren te antre nan mwen e tout fòs mwen te kite m. <verse eid="DAN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:10-11">Egz 24:10-11</ref> </char></note>kòman yon kalite sèvitè konsa kapab pale ak youn tankou senyè mwen an? Epi pou mwen, fòs pa rete nan mwen, ni okenn souf pa rete nan mwen.”<verse eid="DAN 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18"/>Epi sila a ki te sanble ak fis a lòm nan, te touche mwen ankò e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3-4">És 35:3-4</ref> </char></note>ban m fòs. <verse eid="DAN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19"/>Li te di mwen: “O nonm trè byeneme a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:23">Jij 6:23</ref></char></note>pa pè. Lapè avèk ou. Pran kouraj! Wi, se pou vin vanyan!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Alò, depi lè li te fin pale ak mwen an, mwen te resevwa fòs, e mwen te di: “Kite senyè mwen an pale, paske ou te ban m fòs.”<verse eid="DAN 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20"/>Konsa, li te di: “Èske ou pa konprann poukisa mwen te vin kote ou a? Men mwen va retounen koulye a, pou goumen kont prens a Perse la. Lè mwen ale, gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:21">Dan 8:21</ref> </char></note>prens a Grèce la va vini. <verse eid="DAN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21"/>Men mwen va di ou sa ki enskri nan pawòl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:4">Dan 12:4</ref> </char></note>verite a. Nanpwen okenn moun k ap kanpe avè m kont sila yo, sòf ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref> </char></note>Micaël, prens ou an.<verse eid="DAN 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1"/>“Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:31">Dan 5:31</ref> </char></note>premye ane Darius, Mèd la, Mwen te leve pou m ta kapab vin yon ankourajman ak yon pwotèj pou li.<verse eid="DAN 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2"/>“Epi koulye a, mwen va di ou verite a. Gade byen, va gen twa wa ankò ki va leve Perse. Epi katriyèm nan va bokou pi rich ke tout lòt yo. Lè li vin fò akoz richès li yo, li va pwovoke tout pouvwa li a kont wayòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:21">Dan 8:21</ref> </char></note>Grèce la. <verse eid="DAN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3"/>Konsa, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:5-21">Dan 8:5-21</ref> </char></note>wa pwisan va vin leve. Li va gouvène ak gwo otorite e fè sa li pito. <verse eid="DAN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4"/>Epi lè li fin leve, wayòm li an va vin kraze e divize vè kat van syèl yo, men se pa a pwòp desandan pa li, ni selon otorite ke li te gouvène, paske wayòm li an va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:15-17">Jr 12:15-17</ref> </char></note> vin dechouke e vin bay a lòt moun ke yo menm.<verse eid="DAN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5"/>“Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:9-11">Dan 11:9-11</ref> </char></note>wa a Sid la va vin fò, ansanm ak youn nan prens li yo ki va vin pi fò ke li, e li va domine li. Dominasyon li an va vrèman gran. <verse eid="DAN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6"/>Apre kèk ane, yo va fè yon alyans e fi wa a Sid la va vin kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:7-40">Dan 11:7-40</ref> </char></note>wa Nò a pou antann yo pou yo gen lapè. Men fi a p ap ka kenbe pozisyon pouvwa li a. Ni li menm wa Sid la, li p ap ka kenbe pouvwa pa li a; men fi a va vin livre, ansanm ak sila ki te mennen l antre ak sila ki te devni papa l, menm ak sila ki te bay li soutyen nan lè sa yo.<verse eid="DAN 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7"/>“Men youn nan desandan fanmi fi yo va leve nan plas li. Li va vin kont lame pa yo, pou l antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:19-39">Dan 11:19-39</ref> </char></note>sitadèl wa Nò a. Li va aji kont yo, e li va vankre yo. <verse eid="DAN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8"/>Anplis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:19">És 37:19</ref> </char></note>dye, imaj metal, veso presye an ajan ak lò yo, li va pote yo an kaptivite an Egypte. Konsa, li va sispann atake wa Nò a pandan kèk ane. <verse eid="DAN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9"/>Li va antre nan wayòm a wa Sid la, men li va retounen nan pwòp peyi li. <verse eid="DAN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10"/>Fis li yo va rasanble yon gwo lame ki va vin debòde <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:8">És 8:8</ref> </char></note> e travèse. Konsa, yo va retounen fè lagè rive jis nan pwòp sitadèl li a.<verse eid="DAN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 11:5">Dan 11:5</ref> </char>
    </note>“Wa Sid la va anraje e vin goumen ak wa Nò a. Epi dezyèm nan va leve yon gwo foul lame kont premye a, men foul lame sila a va livre nan men a premye a. <verse eid="DAN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12"/>Epi foul lame a va vin leve retire. Kè li va vin egzalte e li va fè sòlda tonbe pa di-milye, men, li p ap ka enpoze li. <verse eid="DAN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13"/>Paske, wa Nò a va retounen e leve yon foul ki pi gwo ke sa avan an. Epi li va vini nan fen tan yo, menm nan fen ane yo, avèk yon gwo lame e avèk anpil minisyon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:16">Dan 4:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14"/>“Alò, nan tan sila yo, va gen anpil moun ki va leve kont wa Sid la. Sila ki vyolan pami pèp nou an va leve yo menm pou etabli vizyon an, men yo va tonbe. <verse eid="DAN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15"/>Epi wa Nò a va vini, li va monte yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:6">Jr 6:6</ref> </char></note>teras e li va pran yon vil byen fòtifye. Konsa, lame a Sid yo p ap ka kanpe, ni meyè solda byen chwazi li yo. Li p ap gen okenn fòs pou l ka kanpe. <verse eid="DAN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16"/>Men sila ki vini kont li an va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:19">Dan 5:19</ref> </char></note>fè sa li pito, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5">Jos 1:5</ref> </char></note>nanpwen moun ki ka kanpe devan li. Konsa, li va kanpe nan peyi laglwa a, e nan men li va gen destriksyon. <verse eid="DAN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17"/>Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:17">II Wa 12:17</ref> </char></note>mete fas li pou vini ak pouvwa a tout wayòm li a. Li va mennen avèk li yon pwopozisyon lapè, ke li va etabli. Li va anplis bay li fi a fanm nan pou detwi wayòm nan. Men li p ap kanpe pou li, ni bay li soutyen. <verse eid="DAN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18"/>Apre sa li va vire fas li vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:5">Jen 10:5</ref> </char></note>peyi kot yo, e li va kaptire anpil nan yo. Men yon chèf va fè repwòch li a sispann. Anplis, li va fè l peye pou ensolans li. <verse eid="DAN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19"/>Konsa, li va vire fas li vè fòterès pwòp peyi li a, men li va glise tonbe, e li p ap ka releve ankò.<verse eid="DAN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20"/>“Epi nan plas li a, yon moun va koze yon mèt kontribisyon a travèse wayòm nan pou kontwole glwa li. Malgre sa, nan kèk jou, li va vin detwi, malgre se pa ni nan kòlè, ni nan batay.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:17">És 60:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="DAN 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21"/>“Nan plas li a, yon nonm meprizab va vin leve, a sila tit a wa a pa t vin bay. Men li va vini nan yon tan trankil e li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:6">II Sam 15:6</ref> </char></note>sezi wayòm nan ak ti manèv koken flatè moun. <verse eid="DAN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:26">Dan 9:26</ref> </char></note>Lame debòde peyi a va soti devan l, e vin kraze nèt, ansanm ak prens akò a. <verse eid="DAN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23"/>Apre yon akò lapè fin fèt ak li, li va fè travay desepsyon. Li va monte reyisi pran pouvwa a ak yon ti ekip tou piti. <verse eid="DAN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24"/>Nan tan lapè a, li va antre nan pati wayòm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:20">Nonb 13:20</ref> </char></note>pi rich la, e li va fè sa ke zansèt li yo pa t janm fè, ni zansèt zansèt li yo. Li va distribye piyaj ak byen yo pami yo. Konsa, li va fòme yon plan kont sitadèl yo, men sèlman pou yon ti tan.<verse eid="DAN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25"/>“Li va pwovoke pwisans ak kouraj li kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:5">Dan 11:5</ref> </char></note>wa a Sid la ak yon gwo lame. Konsa, wa Sid la va fòme yon vrèman gwo lame pou fè lagè, men li p ap ka kanpe, paske yo va fòme yon plan kont li. <verse eid="DAN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26"/>Sila ki te kon manje pi bon manje nan men l, va detwi li, epi lame li a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:10-40">Dan 11:10-40</ref> </char></note>bale nèt. Konsa, anpil moun va tonbe mouri. <verse eid="DAN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27"/>Selon toulède wa sa yo, kè yo apiye vè fè mal. Yo va pale manti youn ak lòt sou menm tab, men sa p ap reyisi, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:19">Dan 8:19</ref> </char></note>fen an toujou gen pou vini nan lè apwente a. <verse eid="DAN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28"/>Konsa, li va retounen nan sid, nan peyi li ak anpil piyaj. Men kè li va kont akò sen an, e li va pran desizyon retounen nan peyi li.<verse eid="DAN 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29"/>“Nan lè apwente a, li va retounen antre nan Sid la. Men nan fwa sa a, li p ap menm jan li te ye fwa avan an. <verse eid="DAN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30"/>Paske bato a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:4">Jen 10:4</ref> </char></note>Kittim yo va vini kont li. Akoz sa, li va vin gen chagren. Li va retounen byen anraje kont akò sen an, e li va aji. Konsa, li va retounen pran desizyon pou antann li ak sila ki vyole akò sen yo.<verse eid="DAN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31"/>“Sòlda li yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:11-13">Dan 8:11-13</ref></char></note> pwofane sanktyè a, fò a menm, e fè sakrifis nòmal la vin sispann. Konsa, yo va fè monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref> </char></note>abominasyon dezolasyon an. <verse eid="DAN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32"/>Ak lèv flatè, li va sedwi sila ki vyole akò yo, men pèp ki konnen Bondye a va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:7-9">Mi 5:7-9</ref> </char></note>kanpe fèm pou aji.<verse eid="DAN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Sila ki gen bon konprann pami pèp la va bay konesans a anpil moun. Malgre sa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mat 24:9</ref> </char></note>tonbe pa nepe, pa dife, pa kaptivite e pa piyaj pandan anpil jou. <verse eid="DAN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34"/>Alò, lè yo tonbe, yo va resevwa yon ti èd, men anpil lòt moun va vin jwenn ak yo an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:21-32">Dan 11:21-32</ref> </char></note>ipokrizi. <verse eid="DAN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35"/>Kèk nan sila ki gen bon konprann yo va tonbe pou yo ka rafine <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:2">Jn 15:2</ref></char></note>pirifye, e fè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:14">Rev 7:14</ref> </char></note>blan, jis menm lè dènye tan an rive. Akoz li toujou gen pou vini nan lè apwente a.<verse eid="DAN 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36"/>“Konsa, wa a va fè sa li pito. Li va vin egzalte. Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13">És 14:13</ref></char></note>bay tèt li glwa pi wo pase tout dye yo, e li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:5">Rev 13:5</ref>,<ref loc="REV 13:6">6</ref> </char></note>pale anpil bagay byen move kont Bondye a dye yo. Konsa, li va pwospere jiskaske endiyasyon an fini, paske dekrè ki pibliye a va akonpli. <verse eid="DAN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37"/>Li p ap montre okenn respè pou dye a zansèt li yo, ni pou dezi fanm, ni li p ap gen respè pou okenn lòt dye. Paske li va leve tèt li ak glwa pi wo ke yo tout. <verse eid="DAN 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38"/>Men olye de sa, li va bay glwa a dye a fòterès yo. Yon dye ke zansèt li yo pa t konnen, li va bay glwa ak lò, ajan, pyè presye ak trezò. <verse eid="DAN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39"/>Li va aji kont fòterès ki pi fò yo ak soutyen a yon dye etranje. Nenpòt moun ki rekonèt li, li va ogmante yo ak glwa, e li va fè yo domine sou anpil, e va divize teritwa a pou yon pri.<verse eid="DAN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40"/>“Nan lè lafen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:11">Dan 11:11</ref></char></note>wa Sid la va atake li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:7">Dan 11:7</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 11:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 11:15">15</ref> </char></note>Wa Nò a va rive kont li ak cha, ak chevalye, e ak anpil bato. Epi li va antre nan peyi yo, debòde yo e pase anndan yo. <verse eid="DAN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41"/>Anplis, li va antre nan Peyi Laglwa a, e anpil peyi va ranvèse. Men sila yo va delivre soti nan men li: Edom <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:47">Jr 48:47</ref></char></note>Moab, ak premye nan fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:6">Jr 49:6</ref> </char></note>Ammon yo. <verse eid="DAN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42"/>Anplis, li va lonje men li kont lòt peyi yo, e peyi Egypte la p ap chape. <verse eid="DAN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43"/>Men li va pran kontwòl tout trezò kache ak lò, ajan ak tout bagay presye an Egypte yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:3">II Kwo 12:3</ref></char></note>Libyen yo ak Etyopyen yo va swiv pye li yo. <verse eid="DAN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44"/>Men rimè ki sòti nan Lès ak nan Nò va vin twouble li. Li va soti deyò ak gwo kòlè pou detwi e fè anpil disparèt nèt. <verse eid="DAN 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45"/>Li va fè monte tant a palè li a antre lanmè a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:9">És 11:9</ref> </char></note>Mòn Sen Laglwa a. Malgre sa, li va rive nan fen li e nanpwen moun k ap bay li soutyen.<verse eid="DAN 11:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1"/>“Alò, nan lè sa a, Micaël, gran prens ki te kanpe pou fis a pèp ou yo, va leve. Epi va gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:14">Rev 7:14</ref></char></note>yon tan gwo twoub <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:7">Jr 30:7</ref> </char></note>jan sa pa t janm te konn fèt soti lè te gen yon nasyon jis rive nan lè sa a. Epi nan lè sa a, pèp ou a va vin delivre, tout moun ke gen non ekri nan liv la. <verse eid="DAN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:19">És 26:19</ref></char></note>Anpil nan sila ki dòmi nan pousyè latè yo va leve, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:46">Mat 25:46</ref> </char></note>yon pati pou lavi etènèl yo, men lòt yo pou gwo wont ak mepriz ki p ap janm fini. <verse eid="DAN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3"/>Sila ki gen bon konprann yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:35">Jn 5:35</ref></char></note>briye klè tankou ekla a tout syèl la. Epi sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:11">És 53:11</ref> </char></note>mennen anpil moun vè ladwati yo, va brile tankou zetwal jis pou tout tan, e pou tout tan. <verse eid="DAN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4"/>Men ou menm, Daniel, kache pawòl sila yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:16">És 8:16</ref></char></note>sele liv la nèt, jis rive nan fen tan yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:9">És 11:9</ref> </char></note>Anpil moun va kouri fè ale vini, e konesans va ogmante.”<verse eid="DAN 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5"/>Epi mwen menm, Daniel te gade, e vwala, de lòt moun te kanpe, youn sou bò rivyè sa a, e lòt la sou lòtbò a. <verse eid="DAN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6"/>Konsa youn te di a mesye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:2">Éz 9:2</ref></char></note>abiye an len an, ki te sou dlo rivyè a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:13">Dan 8:13</ref> </char></note>“Konbyen tan pou rive nan fen a bagay mèvèy sila yo?”<verse eid="DAN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7"/>Mwen te tande nonm abiye an len an, ki te sou dlo rivyè a, lè l te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:5">Éz 20:5</ref></char></note>leve men dwat li ak men goch li vè syèl la. Li te jire pa li menm ki viv pou tout tan an, ki li va pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref> </char></note>yon tan, tan yo, ak yon mwatye tan. Lè yo fin kraze pouvwa a pèp sen an, tout evenman sila yo va fini.<verse eid="DAN 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8"/>Konsa, mwen te tande, men mwen pa t ka konprann. Akoz sa, mwen te di: “Senyè mwen, kisa ki va fen a evenman sila yo?”<verse eid="DAN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9"/>Li te di: “Ale, Daniel, paske pawòl sila yo kache e sele nèt, jiska moman lafen an. <verse eid="DAN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10"/>Anpil moun va pirifye tèt yo, e fè tèt yo blan pou vin rafine, men mechan yo va aji ak mechanste. Konsa okenn nan mechan yo p ap konprann, men sila ki gen sajès yo va konprann.<verse eid="DAN 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11"/>“Soti nan lè ke sakrifis nòmal la te vin aboli a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref> </char></note>abominasyon ak dezolasyon vin monte a, va genyen mil-de-san-katreven-dis (1,290) jou. <verse eid="DAN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12"/>Beni se sila ki va tann, e rive jis nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:14">Dan 8:14</ref> </char></note>Mil-twa-san-trann-senk (1,335) jou yo.<verse eid="DAN 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13"/>“Men ou menm, kontinye fè wout ou, jis rive nan fen an. Paske ou va antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:2">És 57:2</ref> </char></note>repo, e ou va kanpe ankò pou pòsyon eritaj pa ou a nan fen jou yo.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12"/>
</usx>
